@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Resume Picker Progress
+
+- The resume picker shows position, loaded session count and scroll percentage beside its top-left title.
+- The progress text keeps the existing secondary gray style.
+- The independent bottom progress separator is removed.
+- The list gains the row previously used by that separator.
+- The resume list has no upper or lower more-indicator rows because progress already appears in the header.
+- Both reclaimed rows remain available for sessions while more pages are loading.
+- Paging and rendering use the same enlarged list geometry.
+- Profile shortcut lines reserve their actual wrapped height in that shared geometry.
+- Narrow headers use the existing compact progress forms when the full label does not fit.
+- The fork picker and response browser retain their existing footer geometry and progress placement.
